OL,3,GNEWSAReform UK councillor refuses to
OL,4,Arejoin party
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Reform UK councillor is now serving
OL,7,Fas an independent after he said he
OL,8,Fwould not renew his membership of the
OL,9,Fparty.
OL,11,FReform has removed the whip from Robert
OL,12,FHanson on its Sheffield City Council
OL,13,Fgroup because it emerged he was no
OL,14,Flonger a member and would not rejoin.
OL,16,FHanson had acted as the group's
OL,17,Fspokesperson on the adult health and
OL,18,Fsocial care policy committee since
OL,19,Fwinning a seat in the Firth Park ward
OL,20,Fin May's local elections.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
