OL,3,GNEWSAReform UK councillor refuses to
OL,4,Arejoin party
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Reform spokesman said that "despite
OL,7,Fbeing given repeated opportunities to
OL,8,Fjoin the party by email and telephone,
OL,9,Fhe refused to do so". Hanson has been
OL,10,Fapproached for comment.
